title: "BFS-Avoidance Frontier: Rigidity Theorems for Pattern-Avoiding BFS Words of Increasing Trees"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bona"
    given-names: "Victor"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - enumerative combinatorics
  - pattern avoidance
  - increasing trees
  - binary heaps
  - OEIS
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Two rigidity theorems about breadth-first-search reading words of
  increasing trees, resolving three conjectures recorded in the OEIS
  (A245898-A245903, A246747), with prose proofs, exhaustive computational
  verification, and complete machine-checked formalizations in Lean 4.
